<view class="{{styles.grid}}">
  <view class="{{styles.panel}}">
    <view>账户余额</view>
    <view wx:if="{{failure}}" role="alert">
      <text>读取或操作失败：</text>
      <text>{{failure}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!wallet}}">
      <text>
        <text wx:if="{{busy}}">{{"读取中…"}}</text>
        <text wx:else>{{"还没有钱包。首次充值后才会创建。"}}</text>
      </text>
    </view>
    <block wx:else>
      <view style="{{{ fontSize: 28, margin: &quot;0 0 4px&quot; }}}">{{yuan(wallet.spendableMinor)}}</view>
      <text>可用余额（已扣除执行中任务的冻结）</text>
      <view>明细</view>
      <text>
        <text>账面余额</text>
        <text>{{yuan(wallet.balanceMinor)}}</text>
      </text>
      <text>
        <text>执行中冻结</text>
        <text>{{yuan(wallet.reservedMinor)}}</text>
      </text>
      <text>冻结是任务开始时按预估扣下的，任务结束后按实际用量结算，
                多冻的会退回可用余额。它还在你的账面余额里，只是暂时不能用于新任务。</text>
      <view wx:if="{{frozen}}" role="alert">
        <text>钱包当前状态为</text>
        <text>{{wallet.status}}</text>
        <text>，无法充值或消费。请联系运营。</text>
      </view>
    </block>
    <button class="button" type="button" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onTap">
      <text wx:if="{{busy}}">{{"读取中…"}}</text>
      <text wx:else>{{"刷新"}}</text>
    </button>
  </view>
  <view class="{{styles.panel}}">
    <view>充值</view>
    <view>
      <text>余额与套餐并存：任务优先消耗套餐配额，配额不足时才动余额。
              充值不会改变你的套餐。</text>
    </view>
    <form bindsubmit="submitTopup">
      <text>
        <text>
          <text>金额（元）</text>
          <text wx:if="{{minTopup !== null && maxTopup !== null}}">{{` · 单笔 ${yuan(minTopup)} — ${yuan(maxTopup)}`}}</text>
        </text>
        <input value="{{amountYuan}}" aria-label="充值金额（元）" inputMode="decimal" placeholder="100" disabled="{{busy || frozen}}" required="true" bindchange="onChange" />
      </text>
      <button class="button primary" type="submit" disabled="{{busy || frozen}}">
        <text wx:if="{{busy}}">{{"提交中…"}}</text>
        <text wx:else>{{"发起充值"}}</text>
      </button>
    </form>
    <view wx:if="{{feedback}}" class="{{styles.feedback}}" role="status">{{feedback}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{handoff}}" class="{{styles.token}}">
      <text>
        <text>订单</text>
        <text>{{handoff.topupOrderId}}</text>
        <text>·</text>
        <text>{{yuan(handoff.amountMinor)}}</text>
        <text>·</text>
        <text>{{handoff.status}}</text>
      </text>
      <navigator wx:if="{{handoff.checkoutUrl}}" class="button" href="{{handoff.checkoutUrl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往付款</navigator>
      <block wx:if="{{handoff.qrCodeUrl}}">
        <text>微信扫码付款（二维码内容）：</text>
        <code>{{handoff.qrCodeUrl}}</code>
      </block>
      <text>
        <text wx:if="{{handoff.status === "PAID"}}">{{"已收到付款，正在入账——入账由支付回调完成，通常几秒内。"}}</text>
        <text wx:else>{{`付款有效期至 ${moment(handoff.expiresAt)}。超时后这笔订单作废，可以重新发起。`}}</text>
      </text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="{{styles.members}}">
  <view>
    <view>账户流水</view>
    <text>
      <text>最近</text>
      <text>{{ledger.length}}</text>
      <text>条 · 只读</text>
    </text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{ledger.length === 0}}">
    <text>还没有流水。充值入账、任务消费、退款和人工调整都会记在这里。</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="{{styles.memberList}}">
    <view wx:for="{{ledger}}" wx:for-item="entry" wx:key="entry.id" class="{{styles.member}}" key="{{entry.entryId}}">
      <view>
        <text>{{entryLabels[entry.entryType] ?? entry.entryType}}</text>
        <text title="{{entry.sourceRef}}">
          <text>{{moment(entry.occurredAt)}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{entry.reason}}">{{` · ${entry.reason}`}}</text>
          <text wx:else>{{""}}</text>
        </text>
      </view>
      <text style="{{{ textAlign: &quot;right&quot; }}}">
        <text wx:if="{{entry.direction === "CREDIT"}}">{{"+"}}</text>
        <text wx:else>{{"−"}}</text>
        <text>{{yuan(entry.amountMinor)}}</text>
      </text>
      <text>
        <text>余额</text>
        <text>{{yuan(entry.balanceAfterMinor)}}</text>
      </text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <text>流水只记录真实的资金移动。任务执行期间的冻结与释放不在这里，
          它们反映在上方的「执行中冻结」里。</text>
</view>
